{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE CHARACTER, TWO PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input offers a unique platforming experience where control is split between two players.<br>One player manages movement, the other handles actions. Perfect coordination is the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9643602568bc5bd9606218d19b9f56d8.poster.avif?t=1765892020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9643602568bc5bd9606218d19b9f56d8.webm?t=1765892020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9643602568bc5bd9606218d19b9f56d8.mp4?t=1765892020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIMING IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single mistimed input means failure. Levels are designed to push your reflexes and teamwork to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/092c4e3fb0a52ac017ef42e0f4d09832.poster.avif?t=1765892020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/092c4e3fb0a52ac017ef42e0f4d09832.webm?t=1765892020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/092c4e3fb0a52ac017ef42e0f4d09832.mp4?t=1765892020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARKOUR AND PLATFORMING CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, cling to walls, and overcome obstacles. Parkour-inspired levels will test both your speed and your cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/85d828d0b0ec15e9370c07f9bcd272ac.poster.avif?t=1765892020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/85d828d0b0ec15e9370c07f9bcd272ac.webm?t=1765892020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE MOVES, THE OTHER ACTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input is built exclusively for two players. With one responsible for movement and the other for actions, every step requires flawless collaboration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIMALIST DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, stylized aesthetic keeps your focus on the gameplay itself. Each level is a clear but demanding challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One character controlled by two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour-inspired, challenging platforming levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay based entirely on timing and coordination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals with a focused design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Input</strong> looks simple but mastering it is anything but easy. Without true cooperation, no obstacle can be overcome.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016010?t=1765892020","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/c52b9f5f9d4046afd09431dbf9650476b5644e0d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765892020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_