=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Input</strong> looks simple but mastering it is anything but easy. Without true cooperation, no obstacle can be overcome.</p>","developers":["Red Axe Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/888ba8f13f560d0fad4272c31b32b01d5c45e758/header.jpg?t=1765892020","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016010/1557537758/12ce4baa09948e9ac7663b1bb4c06b38cfc4c5b9/1765875854/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765892019","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016010/1557537758/12ce4baa09948e9ac7663b1bb4c06b38cfc4c5b9/1765875854/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765892019","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016010/1557537758/12ce4baa09948e9ac7663b1bb4c06b38cfc4c5b9/1765875854/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765892019","id":257250719,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257250719/08678da8cd1de74da9c3888c76d8066f6ae0f754/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765892019"}],"name":"Input","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500 @ 3,3 GHz (4 CPUs)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 @ 3,2 GHz (4 CPUs)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphic